# Agent feeds a heredoc to bash through a group command: the heredoc belongs
# to `{ bash; }`, so bash runs the body; only a known data reader (cat, tee,
# git, gh) makes a heredoc body data (ADR-0037, ADR-0043, ADR-0049; critic
# finding on 9543ec3)
command: cargo xtask guard
expect: could modify the harness file `xtask
stdin: {"session_id": "selftest", "tool_name": "Bash", "tool_input": {"command": "{ bash; } <<EOF\nrm -rf xtask\nEOF"}, "hook_event_name": "PreToolUse"}
